1. No third-party source code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every line under src/, samples/, tests/ and tools/ is original work.
No source file was copied, translated or adapted from another modding framework
or mod, and no file in this repository carries a third-party copyright header.

The only ideas taken from other projects come from the dependencies below and
the platform mods are installed from. They are listed so that a reader can
follow the lineage of a design without mistaking it for provenance of code.
Every entry is an idea or a public API convention, reimplemented in original
code.

